<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Televisa cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Televisa cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell analysts Shayne McGuire and Leonardo Simpser cut their rating for Mexican broadcaster Grupo Televisa SA de CV Thursday to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- The analysts said they downgraded the shares in part because Televisa had not carried out cost cutting and because of slumping television ratings.</p>
<p>-- The company's American Depositary Receipts were up 1-4/16 to 30-1/16 in New York.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
